@startuml 05-combat-sequence-as-is

' Model: As-Is
' UE baseline: dead903156946ec6956342f02d587612baab1717
' AI service baseline: f548c1ad64c5d284eace084132616d171d45403f
' Evidence: UE-INPUT-IMC-COMBAT-001, UE-INPUT-LIGHT-001,
'           UE-INPUT-HEAVY-001, UE-PLAYER-001, UE-TARGETING-001,
'           UE-COMBAT-001, UE-HEALTH-001, UE-POISE-001,
'           UE-COMBAT-STATE-001, UE-ENEMY-001, UE-ENEMY-BP-001, UE-MATCH-001,
'           UE-HUD-BP-HEALTH-001, UE-ENEMY-HUD-BP-CALL-001,
'           UE-RESULT-HUD-BP-CALL-001

title 玩家近战攻击结算时序（As-Is）

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FE
  BorderColor #315A93
  FontColor #172554
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #F8E7C4
  BorderColor #8A5A20
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DB
  BorderColor #9A7B16
}

actor 玩家 as User
boundary "IMC_AesirCombat\nIA_LightAttack / IA_HeavyAttack" as Input
participant "AAesirPlayerCharacter" as Player
control "UAesirTargetingComponent" as Targeting
control "UAesirCombatComponent" as Combat
boundary "AnimInstance / Montage" as Animation
participant "BP_AesirEnemyCharacter\n(AAesirEnemyCharacter)" as Enemy
control "UAesirHealthComponent" as Health
control "UAesirPoiseComponent" as Poise
control "UAesirCombatStateComponent" as State
boundary "WBP_EnemyHealthBar" as HealthBar
control "AAesirCombatPrototypeGameMode" as GameMode
boundary "WBP_CombatResult" as ResultUI

User -> Input : 按下轻击或重击键
Input -> Player : Enhanced Input Started

alt 玩家死亡、受击硬直或正在闪避
  Player --> Input : 忽略输入
else 允许攻击
  Player -> Targeting : GetCurrentTarget()
  alt 没有锁定目标
    Player -> Targeting : FindBestTarget(AssistRadius, MaxViewAngle)
    Targeting --> Player : 最优敌人或 null
  else 已锁定
    Targeting --> Player : CurrentTarget
  end

  Player -> Combat : TryLightAttack() / TryHeavyAttack()
  Combat -> Animation : Montage_Play(当前连段片段)
  Animation --> Combat : 播放成功
  Combat --> Player : OnAttackStateChanged(true)
  Player -> State : SetCombatState(Attacking)

  Animation -> Combat : NotifyBegin(AttackWindow)
  Combat -> Combat : BeginAttackTrace()

  loop AttackWindow 每帧
    Combat -> Combat : 读取武器 TraceStart/TraceEnd Socket
    Combat -> Enemy : SweepMultiByObjectType(ECC_Pawn)
    alt 本次攻击尚未命中过该 Actor
      Combat -> Enemy : ApplyPointDamage(轻/重攻击伤害)

      group UE Damage Event 分发（不声明回调先后）
        Enemy -> Health : OnTakePointDamage
        Health --> Enemy : OnHitReceived(Location, Causer, Fatal)
        Enemy -> Health : OnTakeAnyDamage
        Health -> Health : Clamp(CurrentHealth - Damage)
        Health --> Enemy : OnHealthChanged(Current, Max, Delta)
        Enemy -> HealthBar : SetEnemyHealth(Current, Max)
      end

      Combat -> Poise : ApplyPoiseDamage(轻/重韧性伤害)
      alt 韧性降至 0
        Poise --> Enemy : OnPoiseBroken
        Enemy -> State : SetCombatState(Stunned)
        Enemy -> Combat : CancelAttack()
      end

      alt 生命降至 0
        Health --> Enemy : OnDeath(Instigator, Causer)
        Enemy -> State : SetCombatState(Dead)
        Health --> GameMode : OnDeath(Instigator, Causer)
        GameMode -> GameMode : RemainingEnemies -= 1
        opt RemainingEnemies == 0
          GameMode -> GameMode : FinishCombat(Victory)
          GameMode --> ResultUI : OnCombatEnded(Victory)
        end
      end
    else 已命中过
      Combat -> Combat : 跳过重复结算
    end
  end

  Animation -> Combat : NotifyEnd(AttackWindow)
  Combat -> Combat : EndAttackTrace()
  Animation -> Combat : OnMontageEnded
  Combat --> Player : OnAttackStateChanged(false)
  Player -> State : SetCombatState(Combat 或 Idle)
end

note over Combat,Poise
  轻/重攻击的生命与韧性数值来自 CombatComponent 配置。
  MiniBoss 与普通敌人的 Health、Poise 差异目前为临时值，
  本图不把临时数值固化成领域规则。
end note

note over Health,GameMode
  HealthComponent 同时监听 AnyDamage 与 PointDamage：
  前者扣血并广播 Health/Death，后者广播命中反馈。
  图只表达因果，不依赖两个引擎委托的具体先后顺序。
end note

@enduml
